repository-code: "https://github.com/cryogars/CryoPit"
url: "https://github.com/cryogars/CryoPit"
abstract: >-
  CryoPit is an offline-first application for structured collection,
  validation, archiving, and retrieval of snow-pit observations. It links
  measurements, stratigraphy, photographs, metadata, and archive products
  through stable pit identifiers and supports local field deployments,
  institutional authentication, and later database consolidation.
keywords:
  - "snow pit"
  - "snow stratigraphy"
  - "snow hydrology"
  - "field observations"
  - "cryosphere"
  - "scientific software"
  - "SQLite"
